### EVisionBet API Test Suite
### Use VS Code REST Client extension to test all endpoints
### Click "Send Request" above each request to execute

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@limit = 20
@sport = basketball_nba

### ============================================================================
### HEALTH & STATUS
### ============================================================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Root Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ============================================================================
### EV OPPORTUNITIES (Main Endpoint)
### ============================================================================

### Get All EV Hits (Default - All Sports, Top 50)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ev/hits

### Get EV Hits with Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ev/hits?limit={{limit}}

### Get EV Hits for Specific Sport
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ev/hits?sport={{sport}}&limit={{limit}}

### Get EV Hits with Minimum EV Threshold
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ev/hits?min_ev=0.05&limit={{limit}}

### Get EV Hits with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ev/hits?limit=10&offset=0

### Get EV Hits - Combined (All Sports)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ev/hits?limit={{limit}}&offset=0

### ============================================================================
### OUTLIERS (New Endpoint)
### ============================================================================

### Get All Outliers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outliers

### Get Outliers for Sport
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outliers?sport={{sport}}&limit={{limit}}

### Get Outliers with Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/outliers?limit={{limit}}

### ============================================================================
### SUMMARY STATISTICS
### ============================================================================

### Get EV Summary Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ev/summary

### ============================================================================
### RAW ODDS (For Debugging)
### ============================================================================

### Get Latest Odds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odds/latest?limit={{limit}}

### Get Latest Odds for Sport
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odds/latest?sport={{sport}}&limit={{limit}}

### Get Raw Odds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/odds/raw?limit=100&offset=0

### ============================================================================
### ADMIN ENDPOINTS (Auth Required)
### ============================================================================

### Admin Login (Get Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth?password=admin123

### Download EV Opportunities CSV (Requires Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ev-opportunities-csv
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Download Raw Odds CSV (Requires Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/raw-odds-csv
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Database Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/database-stats

### ============================================================================
### NOTES
### ============================================================================
### 1. Make sure backend is running: uvicorn backend_api:app --reload
### 2. Make sure frontend is running: npm start
### 3. Use @baseUrl, @limit, @sport variables at top to customize requests
### 4. Click "Send Request" link above each request to execute
### 5. Response shown in right panel
### 6. For admin endpoints, first call login endpoint to get token
